{"unit_id":"GallenShao__dsh-faster-compress#card-zh","repo":"GallenShao/dsh-faster-compress","commit":"1d87b06028521b419d64ec1ccc34c512007238b7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Faster Compress 是适用于 DSH Web 的上下文压缩插件：它在会话继续工作时后台准备摘要，并在安全步骤边界应用。它沿用当前模型和凭据，保留准备期间新增的消息；准备失败或失效时回退原生压缩。插件还提供压缩历史界面，可查看摘要、状态、耗时及 token 用量。适合长对话和频繁工具调用；默认无需新增 API Key，历史记录保存在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:11-14","src/engine.js:251-300","src/trace.js:78-100"]}
{"unit_id":"GallenShao__dsh-faster-compress#card-en","repo":"GallenShao/dsh-faster-compress","commit":"1d87b06028521b419d64ec1ccc34c512007238b7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Faster Compress prepares context summaries in the background while DSH sessions continue, then applies them at a safe step boundary. Failed preparation falls back to native compaction. Compaction History shows summaries, status, timings, and token usage. No new API key is required by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:11-14","src/engine.js:251-300","src/trace.js:78-100"]}
