{"unit_id":"GallenShao__dsh-faster-compress#feature-1","repo":"GallenShao/dsh-faster-compress","commit":"1d87b06028521b419d64ec1ccc34c512007238b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Faster Compress 的功能「后台准备摘要」：达到准备阈值后，在主任务继续推进时启动摘要生成；摘要先暂存，不会立刻改写会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/engine.js:283-289"]}
